 "_intl_note": "No DOT city-pair data exists for these. Same labelled-estimate approach used for Charlotte: a typical round-trip fare for the market, carried across origins unless a route has origin-specific service that clearly changes it. These are estimates, and the site must keep labelling them as such. EXPANDED 2026-08-13 to 50 markets for the Charlotte only pivot. 46 of them are CLT NONSTOPS, cross checked across FlightsFrom, FlightConnections, Charlotte Magazine and SouthPark Magazine. The remaining four (Amsterdam, Lisbon, Barcelona, Reykjavik) are one stop markets Charlotte genuinely books, and the pipeline labels stops on every slide, so nothing is hidden. Levels are ESTIMATES and must keep saying so.",
